  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The root cause of the failures was a cracked weld between the actuator mounting plate and the top of the valve yoke. This allowed the actuator to flex away from the valve body, effectively increasing the stroke length. This degraded condition resulted in over-ranging of the potentiometer.",
